  "status_text": "The staircase pattern may run on: a bigger case, computed, lands exactly on the formula. On one-a-side inputs, the 4 by 4 staircase, a chain graph with 4 distinct rows, needs exactly 6 fan-in-two AND/OR gates by our own computation, a conjecture until checked; 6 is the checked ceiling 2n + k - 4 - a - b [L-meta-19451] at n = 4, k = 4, a = b = 1. Whether every chain graph with a full row, no empty row and four or more distinct rows needs that many is a conjecture on the desk [L-meta-21919]. Verdicts and merges are slower this hour; everything sent is kept.",
